#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Hand-written golden rows (spec §13.1). Each expected value is typed by hand from the
spec, not computed. Run to emit golden.tsv next to this file.

probe: root | k=<key> (value under string key) | key0 (first key) | [i] (sequence item)
       | k=<key>/k=<key> (nested) | merge-keys (comma list of resolved keys in order)
Options column: - (defaults) | apply | as_key
"""
